# Things 4 Good

> Things 4 Good is the Thingelstad family's annual handmade-candle fundraiser in Minneapolis. Since {{ metrics.perYear[0].year }} the family has hand-poured wooden-wick candles for a fall sale; every candle is a ${{ site.pricePerCandle }} donation, and 100% goes to the nonprofits the four family members pick each year. That has added up to ${{ metrics.grandTotalDisplay | safe }} for {{ metrics.orgCount }} organizations.

The {{ site.saleYear }} sale is {{ site.saleDates | safe }} in Minneapolis. Buyers split their donation across that year's four causes; the family covers the materials. Orders of six or more can be preordered for Sunday pickup. Per-nonprofit amounts on the site are estimates; each sale's total is exact.

## Pages

- [Home](https://things4good.xyz/): the fundraiser, how it works, the makers and the sale dates
- [Impact](https://things4good.xyz/impact/): every nonprofit supported, filterable by who picked it and by event
- [Numbers](https://things4good.xyz/stats/): dollars raised, candles sold, growth by year and candle math
- [Preorder](https://things4good.xyz/preorder/): preorder steps, pickup and payment methods
- [FAQ](https://things4good.xyz/faq/): how it works, what it costs and where the money goes
{%- if site.makerNight %}
- [Maker Night](https://things4good.xyz/maker-night/): an evening to hand-pour your own candles, for a donation
{%- endif %}

